      "source_number": "1099",
      "actual_task": "Two travelers leave opposite ends simultaneously and meet after2 hours. The A-starter completes the whole A-B route1 hour40 minutes later than the B-starter. Determine each whole-route time.",
      "requested_answer_components": [
